# @rve/tiptap

Shared library for admin-web and public-web. It has no app to run.

## Read and edit

- The `@rve/tiptap` entry is read-only: `readContent` and `mountReadOnlyContent`. TipTap JSON becomes static HTML. The read path does not import `Editor` or ProseMirror.
- The `@rve/tiptap/editor` entry exports `Editor` and `contentExtensions()` for the admin-web form. public-web does not import this entry and does not install `@tiptap/*`.
- Text is written with text nodes. A link becomes an `a` element only when the address is `http` or `https`.
- CSS is `src/styles/content.css`, class `rve-content`.
- `src/extensions/review-box.ts` is not registered. Do not add it to the schema unless asked.

## Package

- Do not commit `dist`. `prepare` runs `tsc`.
- Both apps install `github:review-everything/rve-tiptap#develop`.
- Each app's lockfile pins that commit. After a new commit lands on `develop`, run `npm update @rve/tiptap` in each app to fetch it and build again.
